    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1412.5567_rag::chunk_012</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2002.01953_rag::chunk_000</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Our approach is enabled particularly by multi-GPU training and by data collection and synthesis strategies</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">strategies for speaker adaptation fall into two broad categories. Many approaches use pre-trained auxiliary encoding networks</hasEvidenceText>
