    <skos:skos_definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A voice conversion paradigm that first uses an automatic speech recognition (ASR) model to transcribe source speech into linguistic contents, which are then used as input by a text-to-speech (TTS) system.</skos:skos_definition>
