    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Such a paradigm, referred to as ASR+TTS, over</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">rst use an automatic speech recognition (ASR) model to transcribe the source speech into the underlying linguistic contents; these are then used as input by a text-to-speech (TTS) system to generate the converted speech.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
