    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">none of these systems solve the entire problem of TTS</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">As text-to-speech (TTS) models have rapidly improved, there is a growing opportunity for a number of applications</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">text to speech (TTS) systems can learn to convincingly mimic speakers across a wide range of acoustic and phonetic styles.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
