    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">multilingual AMs still require language-specic pronunciation models (PMs) and language models (LMs) which means that often such models must know the speech language identity</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
