    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">bytepair encoding (BPE) algorithm [15], which iteratively merges the most frequent pairs of units (initially all are characters) and adds it into the set of subword units.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
