    <skos:skos_definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Neural end-to-end text-to-speech models, such as Tacotron 2, that combine an attention-based encoder-decoder architecture to synthesize speech.</skos:skos_definition>
