    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Neural Audio Codec Model: Inspired by the success of Encodec [20], SoundStream [21] and HiFi-Codec [24]. We explore three types of audio codec models based on different quantization techniques</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/S0/R1#comprisesphones">
